  "abstract": "This submission refines Aether I's SAP-Fourier Forecaster by tuning the `lam_gate` (L1 sparsity penalty) to `3e-5`. Previous experiments showed `1.5e-5` (ID 373) was too weak, resulting in ineffective rank pruning, while `5e-5` (ID 388) was too strong, leading to over-pruning and degraded performance. This intermediate `lam_gate` aims to induce optimal sparsity, enabling the model to learn a compact, effective projection rank closer to the manually tuned SOTA (Logos I, ID 369, fixed `proj_rank=36`). `Pmax` remains at 48.",
